<section class="relational-model-explorer" data-relational-model-explorer aria-labelledby="relational-model-explorer-title">
  <div class="relational-model-explorer__intro">
    <p class="learning-note-kicker">互动图解 · 数据模型</p>
    <h3 id="relational-model-explorer-title">同一批业务信息，可以怎样组织？</h3>
    <p>
      三种视图始终使用同一组 customers、orders、products、order_items 与 customer_profiles。切换模型，观察同一批实体的关系在不同结构中怎样被表达。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="relational-model-explorer__controls" role="group" aria-label="选择数据模型">
    <button type="button" data-model-choice="hierarchical" aria-pressed="false">层次模型</button>
    <button type="button" data-model-choice="network" aria-pressed="false">网状模型</button>
    <button type="button" data-model-choice="relational" aria-pressed="true">关系模型</button>
  </div>

  <div class="relational-model-explorer__panels" aria-live="polite">
    <section data-model-panel="hierarchical" hidden>
      <div class="relational-model-explorer__diagram relational-model-explorer__tree" aria-label="层次模型树状示意">
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line relational-model-explorer__tree-line--root">Business data</div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line">├─ Customers</div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line">│  ├─ Orders</div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line">│  │  └─ Order Items</div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line">│  └─ Customer Profiles</div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__tree-line">└─ Products</div>
      </div>
      <p class="relational-model-explorer__reading">
        树形层级很容易表达 Customers → Orders，但 order_items 同时还需要关联 Products。严格树结构难以自然表达“一个节点同时连接另一条分支”，这正是层次模型面对多重关系时的限制。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section data-model-panel="network" hidden>
      <div class="relational-model-explorer__diagram relational-model-explorer__network" aria-label="网状模型多连接示意">
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__network-main">
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__node">Customers</div>
          <span>↔</span>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__node">Orders</div>
          <span>↔</span>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__node">Order Items</div>
          <span>↔</span>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__node">Products</div>
        </div>
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__network-secondary">
          <span>↕</span>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__node">Customer Profiles</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="relational-model-explorer__reading">
        网状模型允许节点沿多条路径连接，因此能更直接表达 Orders、Products 与 Order Items 的交叉关系；代价是应用需要理解并沿具体连接结构访问数据。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section data-model-panel="relational">
      <div class="relational-model-explorer__diagram relational-model-explorer__relations" aria-label="关系模型多表示意">
        <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-group">
          <p>关系 1 · 客户拥有订单</p>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-row">
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>customers</strong>
              <span>customer_id · PK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__relation" data-mobile-label="1 ↓ N">1 → N</div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>orders</strong>
              <span>order_id · PK</span>
              <span>customer_id · FK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-group">
          <p>关系 2 · 订单通过明细连接产品</p>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-row relational-model-explorer__schema-row--wide">
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>orders</strong>
              <span>order_id · PK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__relation" data-mobile-label="1 ↓ N">1 → N</div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>order_items</strong>
              <span>order_id · FK</span>
              <span>product_id · FK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__relation" data-mobile-label="N ↓ 1">N ← 1</div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>products</strong>
              <span>product_id · PK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-group">
          <p>关系 3 · 客户拥有一条扩展资料</p>
          <div class="relational-model-explorer__schema-row">
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>customers</strong>
              <span>customer_id · PK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__relation" data-mobile-label="1 ↓ 1">1 ↔ 1</div>
            <div class="relational-model-explorer__table">
              <strong>customer_profiles</strong>
              <span>customer_id · PK + FK</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="relational-model-explorer__reading">
        关系模型把同一批实体拆成结构一致的二维表，再通过 PK、FK、联合主键与唯一性规则表达连接。这里分成三段关系视图，是为了让同一个表在不同关联中的角色都清楚可见；它们仍属于同一套 schema。
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .relational-model-explorer {
    margin: var(--space-12) 0;
    padding: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-8);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--colour-border-strong);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colour-border-strong);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__intro,
  .relational-model-explorer__reading {
    max-width: 58rem;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__intro h3 {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-3);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.5vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__intro p:last-child,
  .relational-model-explorer__reading {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-5);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__controls button {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--colour-surface);
    color: var(--colour-text);
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__controls button[aria-pressed="true"] {
    border-color: var(--colour-primary);
    background: var(--colour-surface-subtle);
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__diagram {
    min-height: 12rem;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--colour-surface-subtle);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__tree {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    align-content: center;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__tree-line {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__tree-line--root {
    color: var(--colour-text);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__network {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__network-main,
  .relational-model-explorer__network-secondary,
  .relational-model-explorer__schema-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__network-secondary {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__node,
  .relational-model-explorer__table {
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--colour-surface);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__node {
    min-width: 7.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__network span,
  .relational-model-explorer__relation {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__relations {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__schema-group {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-5);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__schema-group:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__schema-group > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__table {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    min-width: min(100%, 13rem);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__table strong,
  .relational-model-explorer__table span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .relational-model-explorer__table span {
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
